5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Alright, let's find the werewolf quickly. I'm not letting anyone here get hurt.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, young Takumi. Let us observe each other with kindness and wisdom first.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Servas. Let's try to keep things peaceful while we figure this out.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll be watching. It's better to analyze the patterns of speech than to rush.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Logic is the only way. I will remain cautious and observe everyone's reactions.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, you're being too quiet. It makes me suspicious.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,"He is simply reflecting, Takumi. There is strength in silence.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,Is everyone feeling okay? I hope we can trust each other.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,Being quiet isn't a crime. I'm just processing the situation.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Toshio. Rushing to judgment based on silence is illogical.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I just don't like the vibe. I'm going to find the wolf no matter what.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Your passion is admirable, but remember that the wolf hides in plain sight.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Midori,,Maybe we should all share something about ourselves to build trust?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,That seems inefficient. The wolf will just lie to blend in.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,Exactly. Personal anecdotes are irrelevant to the logical deduction of roles.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, keep your logic. I'll do things my way.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
