33,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Listen up! I know who the werewolf is. It's Midori!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Servas,,"That was very fast, Takumi. Are you certain of this?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"What? Takumi, why would you say that? I would never hurt anyone!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Toshio,,A direct accusation on day one. Either he's the Seer or he's trying to stir chaos.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"It is a bold claim. @Takumi, what is the basis for this accusation?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm the Seer! I checked her last night and she's the wolf!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,"If you are the Seer, then we must trust your vision, though it is a heavy burden.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'm not the werewolf! Please, believe me! I'm just a villager!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Midori is the wolf, she'll deny it. If Takumi is lying, he's the wolf or possessed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"The probability of Takumi being the Seer is high given the timing, but we must be sure.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't lie about this stuff! Midori, stop acting!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Midori, your distress seems genuine, but the Seer's word is a powerful tool.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, please! I'm just a normal person! Takumi is making a mistake!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Ryuji, do you see any contradictions in Takumi's behavior?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,Not yet. He is consistent with his personality. Midori's reaction is standard for any innocent.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm sticking with my choice. Vote Midori out!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,I trust the boy's conviction.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,This is a nightmare... please don't do this.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Toshio,,The evidence is the Seer's claim. I'll follow the lead.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"Logically, the Seer's information is the most valuable asset we have.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
